</TabItem>
<TabItem label="iOS">

**IDE: Xcode.**

1. Install the approved **GitHub Copilot for Xcode** application from the official distribution described by GitHub.
2. Open the application and follow its setup flow. Enable the required Accessibility and Xcode Source Editor Extension permissions through macOS settings/the extension flow.
3. Restart Xcode if required, then sign in through the Copilot application using the approved GitHub account.
4. Open the actual app workspace/project and Copilot Chat.

Use your approved compatible release; do not change the project's Xcode version merely to match an example. [GitHub's Xcode installation and permissions guide](https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/copilot-in-your-ide/set-up-copilot/install-copilot-extension?tool=xcode).

</TabItem>
<TabItem label="React Native">

