2. Use VS Code's Copilot setup/sign-in flow with the approved GitHub account. Follow the approved extension installation/update process.
3. Open Copilot Chat and confirm access is available.
4. Keep the existing React Native, TypeScript, and Redux Toolkit configuration. Copilot setup requires no application dependency or native build change.

[GitHub's VS Code setup guidance](https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/copilot-in-your-ide/set-up-copilot/install-copilot-extension?tool=vscode).

</TabItem>
