  permitted content. Do not claim a linked document was read without inspecting it.
- Select the platform rules for the files being changed. React Native work may also
  require the native Android/iOS integration rules.
- Resolve conflicting project/documentation requirements with the owning team.
  Do not invent internal APIs, endpoints, YAML fields, selectors, or commands.

## Always preserve
- Protect confidential information. Never include secrets, signing material,
  production/customer data, private logs, or unapproved context in AI interactions.
- Preserve Clean Architecture, existing feature contracts, lifecycle/cancellation,
  account scope, and the approved authentication/application foundations.
- Preserve Redux Toolkit in React Native. Keep JavaScript tests, Android JUnit
  native device tests, and JUnit XML reporting distinct. Do not switch test frameworks.
- Use approved pinned dependencies and the existing build/test setup. Do not add
  unrelated dependencies, migrations, or repository-wide formatting changes.
- Add meaningful tests and apply the documented 100% production-code coverage scope
  and supported metrics. Do not weaken assertions or exclude executable logic.
- Generate code at authoring time only. Bitrise runs committed, reviewed code;
  do not add LLM generation or automatic AI test repair to CI.
- Keep enrollment secret-free and credentials protected. Preserve governed build
  routes and review gates. An uncertain external write requires reconciliation,
