```

The relative link assumes the proposed layout. Adjust it if your approved shared-rules location differs. A link does **not** prove that the referenced file was loaded: supply the permitted rules explicitly in Chat when necessary and verify the references used.

**Expected result:** both files exist, the shared rules are complete for the selected platform, and the repository instruction file contains the entry-point guidance above. No application packages need to be installed for this configuration.

## 4. Confirm custom instructions are enabled

<Tabs>
<TabItem label="Android">

