4. Check **instruction discovery separately from attached context**: explicitly attaching a file makes its content available, but does not prove automatic repository-instruction discovery works. Inspect the Chat response's reference/context information where available. GitHub documents the repository instruction file appearing in the response references when used. Check the actual response too: a reference or a claim of compliance is not proof that every instruction was followed. [Custom instructions in use](https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/copilot-in-your-ide/customize-copilot/configure-custom-instructions/add-repository-instructions-in-your-ide).
