</MermaidZoom>

Start a new chat **inside the configured project**. Replace the platform marker, supply the synthetic feature contract and existing test context, then send:

```text
Platform: REPLACE_WITH_ANDROID_IOS_OR_REACT_NATIVE

Read the provided engineering rules and relevant project references.
Name the reference files and revisions actually available to this interaction.
If a revision is not supplied, report it as unknown; do not infer one.
Do not claim access to local folders or private links you cannot inspect.

Plan tests for placing a chicken order in My Chicken App.
