### Testing track

1. Open the selected testing track and configure its approved tester list/group and feedback contact through the authorized owner.
2. Save the selected audience and obtain the track's opt-in link.
3. Have an intended tester open that link using the eligible Google account and complete the opt-in process.
4. Install/update from the resulting Play route and verify the expected version/code on the device. Account eligibility, track membership, and device compatibility must match.

Keep opt-in links and tester identities in approved channels. A link alone does not establish tester eligibility. [Testing tracks and access](https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/9845334?hl=en).

### Production release

1. The authorized owner confirms required approvals, destination countries, release notes, and readiness for public availability.
